      ],
      "signals": [
        "peak_speed below reference",
        "throughput below reference"
      ],
      "metric_refs": [
        "metric:peak_speed",
        "metric:throughput"
      ],
      "text": "Fitts 定律描述运动时间与距离/目标宽度所代表的任务难度之间的关系，支持速度与精度需要按任务共同理解。只有场景、目标、输入模式、metric version、校准和质量条件可比时，峰值速度或 throughput 的历史差异才可解释。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source_ref": "research:fitts-1954:speed-accuracy",
          "source_level": "academic_peer_reviewed"
        }
      ],
      "max_claim_level": "research_supported",
      "limitations": [
        "Raw Input 缺少目标宽度时不能自动计算或解释有效 throughput。"
      ],
      "counterevidence": [
        "同一速度在不同距离与目标宽度下代表不同任务要求。"
      ],
      "supported_uses": [
        "mechanism",
        "research_context",
        "diagnostic_scope"
      ]
    },
